---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Services | Foysal Abdullah">
  <main class="container" style="padding-top: 140px; max-width: 900px;">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 80px;">
      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; color: var(--text-muted);">WORKFLOW</p>
      <h1 style="font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 20px 0;">We cannot get a price until we understand your brand.</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 30px;">Depending on the project, we fix the price. Here is how we ensure perfect alignment from day one.</p>
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 16px;">
        <button data-cal-link="foysalabdullah/30min" data-cal-namespace="30min" class="glass-button primary">Book a Call</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Custom Animated Steps -->
    <div class="service-step">
      <div class="step-num">01</div>
      <div class="glass-panel service-content">
        <h3 style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 15px; color: var(--text-main);">Questionnaire & Meeting</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.1rem;">We hop on a meeting to understand what you need, your brand colors, logos, type of animation, time, and budget. You fill out a short form so we learn what your product does, who buys it, and why anyone should care.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-step">
      <div class="step-num">02</div>
      <div class="glass-panel service-content">
        <h3 style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 15px;">Storyboarding</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.1rem;">Before we start animating anything, you see exactly what the video will say and how every frame will look, and once you give your notes we lock the whole thing in.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-step">
      <div class="step-num">03</div>
      <div class="glass-panel service-content">
        <h3 style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 15px;">Animating Everything</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.1rem;">Custom animation, illustrations, and kinetic movement all come from the same in-house team, working on your project from the first day to the last.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-step">
      <div class="step-num">04</div>
      <div class="glass-panel service-content">
        <h3 style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 15px;">Sound Design</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.1rem;">Immersive sound effects, audio mixing, and background music synced perfectly to the animation beats for maximum impact.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-step">
      <div class="step-num">05</div>
      <div class="glass-panel service-content">
        <h3 style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 15px;">Client Revisions</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.1rem;">Yes, I provide 3 free revisions as standard to fine-tune motion timing and details. Major scope changes outside the brief require an additional 30%.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service-step">
      <div class="step-num">06</div>
      <div class="glass-panel service-content">
        <h3 style="font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 15px;">Delivery</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.1rem;">You get the variations and high-resolution master files for every platform you post on, usually within the agreed timeframe from kickoff.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>